{"unit_id":"PaoMoXML__dsh-paste-names#card-zh","repo":"PaoMoXML/dsh-paste-names","commit":"e7a38a16bcef75901d794203b203aafb76592c65","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paste-names 是面向 DSH Web 聊天输入框的文件粘贴与拖放扩展。它在浏览器端捕获非图片文件和文件夹的粘贴、拖放事件，并通过宿主解析会话工作区中的同名路径。粘贴会插入 DSH 原生 @ 路径引用，拖放会插入绝对路径文本；多候选时可通过选择器确认。纯文本和受支持图片沿用 DSH 原有处理，适合需要把工作区文件快速加入对话的 Web 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:566-614","lib/client.js:643-699","lib/index.js:204-261"]}
{"unit_id":"PaoMoXML__dsh-paste-names#card-en","repo":"PaoMoXML/dsh-paste-names","commit":"e7a38a16bcef75901d794203b203aafb76592c65","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-paste-names adds file paste and drop to the DSH Web composer. It resolves paths in the session workspace, inserts native @ references on paste, and inserts absolute paths on drop. Users can choose among duplicate matches.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:566-614","lib/client.js:643-699","lib/index.js:204-261"]}
