{"unit_id":"PaoMoXML__dsh-paste-names#feature-1","repo":"PaoMoXML/dsh-paste-names","commit":"e7a38a16bcef75901d794203b203aafb76592c65","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paste-names 的功能「粘贴文件引用」：在聊天输入框粘贴非图片文件或文件夹后，解析工作区匹配并插入原生 @ 路径引用；无法解析时回退为文件名。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:568-613"]}
{"unit_id":"PaoMoXML__dsh-paste-names#feature-2","repo":"PaoMoXML/dsh-paste-names","commit":"e7a38a16bcef75901d794203b203aafb76592c65","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paste-names 的功能「拖放路径插入」：把非图片文件或文件夹拖到 DSH Web 界面后，按会话工作区解析并插入绝对路径文本；纯图片交由原生附件流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:643-699"]}
{"unit_id":"PaoMoXML__dsh-paste-names#feature-3","repo":"PaoMoXML/dsh-paste-names","commit":"e7a38a16bcef75901d794203b203aafb76592c65","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paste-names 的功能「多路径候选选择」：粘贴或拖放遇到同名多条路径时显示选择器，用户确认后插入所选候选，取消则放弃插入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:315-420","lib/client.js:590-601"]}
{"unit_id":"PaoMoXML__dsh-paste-names#feature-4","repo":"PaoMoXML/dsh-paste-names","commit":"e7a38a16bcef75901d794203b203aafb76592c65","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paste-names 的功能「工作区路径解析」：宿主提供 resolve 路由，按会话 cwd 扫描并缓存 basename 对应的文件或目录路径，支持批量查询。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:56-168","lib/index.js:204-261"]}
{"unit_id":"PaoMoXML__dsh-paste-names#caveat-1","repo":"PaoMoXML/dsh-paste-names","commit":"e7a38a16bcef75901d794203b203aafb76592c65","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paste-names 使用须知：路径按当前 DSH 会话工作区解析；浏览器拖放无法提供源文件的原始路径，因此仅能拼出工作区内匹配项的绝对路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:643-699"]}
{"unit_id":"PaoMoXML__dsh-paste-names#caveat-2","repo":"PaoMoXML/dsh-paste-names","commit":"e7a38a16bcef75901d794203b203aafb76592c65","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paste-names 使用须知：宿主深度扫描设有条目数和时间上限，达到上限时索引可能不完整，并会缩短该索引的缓存时间。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-45","lib/index.js:73-123","lib/index.js:155-168"]}
